EPA SWMM 5.2.4 (https://github.com/USEPA/Stormwater-Management-Model, tag v5.2.4)

SWMM is a dynamic hydrology-hydraulic water quality simulation model developed by the
US Environmental Protection Agency. Its source code is written in C and is released in the
PUBLIC DOMAIN (per the upstream README). The upstream repository ships no separate
LICENSE file; this notice preserves that provenance. Only src/solver/*.c, *.h and
include/swmm5.h are vendored, unmodified.
